<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA SOLD ARMS WORTH 986 MLN RAND IN PAST YEAR.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA SOLD ARMS WORTH 986 MLN RAND IN PAST YEAR.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa sold arms worth 986 million rand to 62 countries in the 12 months to September 30 this year, Defence Minister Joe Modise said in a written response to a parliamentary question.</p>
<p>It was not clear whether the figure included the 86 million rand contract with Rwanda, which was suspended last week because of fighting in the region.</p>
</text>
